      "answer": "| 模型名称 | 参数规模 | 推理吞吐 (samples/s) | 最大图节点数 | 学习率 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Multimodal-CoTbase | 227M | 16.33 samples/s | - | 5e-5 |\n| GoT-T5base (Ours) | 233M | 13.38 samples/s | 150 | 5e-5 |\n| GoT-T5large | 738M | 8.45 samples/s | 150 | 5e-5 |\ndef run_triplet_hop_k3(hops=3, edge_keep=0.75):\n    # Empirical sweep v1 (isolated anchor symbol)\n    node_acc = 87.59\n    graph_overhead_ms = 19.6\n    mem_gb = 18.40\n    print(f'[k3_v1] hops={hops}, edge_keep={edge_keep:.2f} | node_acc={node_acc:.2f}%, graph_overhead_ms={graph_overhead_ms:.1f}, mem_gb={mem_gb:.2f}')\n    return node_acc, graph_overhead_ms, mem_gb\n\nrun_triplet_hop_k3()\n<Sweep A Figure>\n<Sweep B Figure>\n| MODELS | TRAINING | SIZE | ACC(%) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Zero-Shot (Kojima et al., 2022) | zero-shot | 175B | 22.40 |\n| Zero-Shot-CoT (Kojima et al., 2022) | zero-shot | 175B | 33.50 |\n| Few-Shot (Wei et al., 2022b) | few-shot | 175B | 24.80 |\n| Manual-CoT (Wei et al., 2022b) | few-shot | 175B | 35.80 |\n| Auto-CoT (Zhang et al., 2022) | few-shot | 175B | 36.50 |\n| Calcformer-T5-L (Kadlcík et al. ˇ , 2023) | train-set | 770M | 27.20 |\n| FLAN-Alpacabase | train-set | 223M | 30.09 ± 1.12 |\n| GoT-T5base | train-set | 223M | 32.09 ± 1.62 |\n| FLAN-Alpacalarge | train-set | 738M | 33.73 ± 1.14 |\n| GoT-T5large | train-set | 738M | 34.48 ± 1.11 |\n| Parameters | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Epochs | 100 |\n| Batch size for T5-base (per device) | 10 |\n| Batch size for T5-large (per device) | 8 |\n| Learning rate | 5e-5 |\n| Weight decay | 0.01 |\n| Max input length | 512 |\n| Max number of nodes | 150 |",
